Problem-Solution Fit
1. Existing Problem

Users may require access to institution records based on their branch and assigned permissions. Without suitable restrictions, unauthorized users may access or modify records.

2. User Requirement

Users need secure access to only the records and operations that they are authorized to use.

3. Proposed Approach

The project uses ServiceNow ACLs with role-based and script-controlled access logic.

4. Access Control Approach

Separate ACL configurations are used for:

READ
CREATE
WRITE
DELETE
5. Branch-Based Access

The Branch field is used to apply the required record-level restriction.

6. Solution Fit

The proposed solution directly addresses the requirement for controlled and secure record access in ServiceNow.

7. Expected Benefit

The solution improves record security while providing appropriate access to authorized users and administrators.
